				learning, model evaluation, threshold optimization, class-imbalance handling, ensembling,
				Grad-CAM-based interpretability
			</p>
			<p>
				<span class="font-semibold">Functional Genomics &amp; Epigenomics:</span>{" "}
				DNA methylation analysis (Illumina 450K arrays, minfi), differential methylation region
				(DMR) detection, PCA-based batch-effect assessment, R/Bioconductor
			</p>
			<p>
				<span class="font-semibold">Reproducible Workflows &amp; Tools:</span>{" "}
				Python, R, Bash/Linux, SQL, Git/GitHub, Docker, HPC/Slurm, R Markdown, Jupyter Notebooks,
				conda environments
			</p>
		</div>
	</section>

